y 0.0250 outcome_005 threshold, so it remains unresolved. I registered feature_002=1, feature_002=0, feature_060=1, and feature_060=0 context tests to ask whether the feature_029 association is broad or localized; if the context map is consistent and a candidate remains near or above the clinical threshold, validation of H120 is the best next independent test. The feature_001/outcome_001 lead (H12/H114) and the raw positive outcome_008/feature_042 reversal (H96/H97) remain unresolved but imprecise; feature_006/outcome_010 context leads are downgraded because overall validation was weak. Next, prioritize H121-H124 and H120 validation if warranted, while retaining only low-prior broad screens.",
