an anchors: approximately 0.0175 for outcome_006, 0.0250 for outcome_015, and 0.0282 for outcome_008. For signed mean_difference claims, I will require both the point estimate and 95% Welch lower bound to clear the relevant anchor. These are unadjusted overlapping within-dataset subgroup analyses, not external validation, causal effects, or generalizability claims.",
