gh feature_039 H203 +0.077 interval +0.019 to +0.135 further locate feature_042 evidence. However unconditional feature_042 outcome_006 was not accepted after validation H46 rejected, noncarrier feature_042 contexts rejected H212 and H225 and H226, and overall high or low feature_043 direct contrasts H234 and H235 were unresolved because lower bounds did not clear anchor. Carrier high feature_043 H227 remains unresolved with small cell counts. Thus the supported statement is context dependent feature_042 outcome_006 association, strongest in feature_021 carriers and selected strata, not an overall robust feature_042 effect. Negative and attenuation findings are important. Many predictors and subgroups do not show clinically meaningful associations. Several initially promising within dataset contrasts were not independently confirmed, including feature_006 outcome_010, feature_030 outcome_005, feature_029 outcome_005, feature_022 outcome_016, unconditional feature_042 outcome_006, and feature_042 outcome_001. H6 shows statistical separation can fall below the 10 percent clinical anchor. Unresolved leads that should not be treated as supported include feature_008 feature_042 outcome_008 in feature_045=1 contexts, outcome_015 feature_034 borderline H195, carrier high feature_043 H227, several feature_042 outcome_014 and outcome_008 leads, and active but untested proposals H245 through H248. H12 feature_001 outcome_001 remains unresolved with wide uncertainty. All conclusions are unadjusted, overlapping, within supplied dataset associations with opaque predictor labels. They do not establish causality, biological mechanism, or generalizability. The most informative next analysis is external prespecified replication of the feature_021 outcome_006 weaker dependency association and the feature_042 by feature_021 interaction, with multiplicity control, covariate adjustment, and prespecified subgroup definitions. If constrained to additional within dataset work, target sensi